{"c":[{"name":"20261005T102528Z-49569322ff77aac5","text":"H7: a18_vm_walk.py writes results.json after every check and in finally; VM jobs judge it with scripts/vm_results.py, never the transcript's last line. test_a18_vm_walk.py runs the walk against stand-ins on any Mac.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T102528Z-b2fd96251e54b1a0","text":"H7: a writing fix's ⌘Z in TextEdit sends TextEdit one pid-directed ⌘Z (UndoGrant.strategy nativeUndo, NativeUndoApps); nothing restores text after it is sent. Other apps keep the AX restore, which TextEdit-like apps record as a new undo step.","type":"note"}]}
